ul addison honey  are you there  yes  [Applause]  how are you doing i'm doing good  oh you're such a cutie pie you look so  beautiful addison  how did you feel um when you got your  doll i felt really happy and  i felt really excited you're so brave  for everything that you go through and  you do and you're just so strong and  your strength  has been a major impact on my life and  when your dad sends me pictures  the smile i see on your face is like  it's just  it makes life make sense to me and  charlotte  you have come up with this whole  business model and plan  to make it a more comfortable cheerful  and you know connective experience  okay i just finished my bow tie  which is sideways i didn't even know it  could do that  um it looks really nice oh  charlotte see that's why you started  this wonderful company is because you  know how to make people feel  good addison i hope your dog gives you  so much bravery and so many smiles  thank you i have to say charlotte  addison  is one of the bravest young women that i  know  and it has been such a pleasure to know  her and her family over the years  and charlotte you are the kind of person  that makes  life make sense to me and i love  business and i love taking care of  people  and you are the shining example of  bringing those two things together and i  know that  each one of your dolls costs 40 dollars  and that you donate a portion of the  proceeds  to the cleft lip research so our friends  at the craft and fabric retailer joanne  heard about your story and they are  sending you a 5 000  gift card so that you can continue  making your companion dolls  for children who need a little more  charlotte and these beautiful companion  dolls in their life  thank you so much thank you  always to our friends at joann you  always step up to the plate  and charlotte we're going to be  featuring your cause  and your business on our website and in  our small  business guide so that we can continue  to support everything that y